	(text "Button-activated Soil Moisture Meter  -  2xAAA (2.0-3.2V), no regulator\nIdle: MCU in power-down, TPS22917 off -> ~0.5 uA total.  Press SW1 -> PA6 wakes MCU ->\nLOAD_EN high -> VSW powers OLED + sensor -> read, display 15 s -> LOAD_EN low -> sleep."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a814f5db-c162-4e20-9fa7-d47dc887c8de")
	)
	(text "Firmware notes: run at 5 MHz (valid down to 1.8 V). Before LOAD_EN low, disable TWI and set\nPB0/PB1 (and PA5) to input w/o pull-up so the unpowered OLED/sensor aren't back-fed.\nBattery voltage measured internally (ADC: VDD vs. internal reference) - no divider needed.\nOLED module: bridge its onboard 662K LDO (VIN->3V3) so it runs to ~2.2 V. Low-batt cutoff ~2.2 V."
